[54.217514, "o", "total 96\r\ndrwxr-xr-x 12 root root  4096 Jul  2 16:25 .\r\ndrwxr-xr-x  3 root root  4096 Jul  2 16:24 ..\r\ndrwxr-xr-x  8 root root  4096 Jul  2 16:25 .git\r\n-rw-r--r--  1 root root 11338 Jul  2 16:25 LICENSE\r\ndrwxr-xr-x  9 root root  4096 Jul  2 16:25 PT-Retrieval\r\n-rw-r--r--  1 root root  4600 Jul  2 16:25 README.md\r\n-rw-r--r--  1 root root 11055 Jul  2 16:25 arguments.py\r\ndrwxr-xr-x 44 root root  4096 Jul  2 16:25 metrics\r\ndrwxr-xr-x  3 root root  4096 Jul  2 16:25 model\r\n-rw-r--r--  1 root root    80 Jul  2 16:25 requirements.txt\r\n-rw-r--r--  1 root root  5448 Jul  2 16:25 run.py\r\ndrwxr-xr-x  2 root root  4096 Jul  2 16:25 run_script\r\ndrwxr-xr-x  2 root root  4096 Jul  2 16:25 run_script_fewshot\r\ndrwxr-xr-x  2 root root  4096 Jul  2 16:25 run_script_semi\r\n-rw-r--r--  1 root root   816 Jul  2 16:25 search.py\r\ndrwxr-xr-x  2 root root  4096 Jul  2 16:25 search_script\r\ndrwxr-xr-x  8 root root  4096 Jul  2 16:25 tasks\r\ndrwxr-xr-x  2 root root  4096 Jul  2 16:25 training\r\n----README----\r\n"]
[54.221823, "o", "# UPET: Uncertainty-aware Parameter-Efficient Tuning for Semi-supervised Language Understanding"]
[54.222151, "o", "\r\n"]
[54.222345, "o", "\r\n"]
[54.222516, "o", "\r\n"]
[54.222678, "o", "Head Tuning: Training the model with CLS head, whith or whitout prefix / adapter"]
[54.222913, "o", "\r\n"]
[54.223081, "o", "Prompt Tuning: Training the model with prompt and verbalizer (MLM head), whith or whitout prefix / adapter"]
[54.223228, "o", "\r\n"]
[54.223394, "o", "\r\n"]
[54.223641, "o", "augment definition："]
[54.223905, "o", "\r\n"]
[54.224149, "o", "e.g.,"]
[54.224391, "o", "\r\n"]
[54.224677, "o", "--prefix -> --head-prefix or --prompt-prefix"]
[54.224918, "o", "\r\n"]
[54.22517, "o", "--prompt -> --head-ptuning or --prompt-ptuning"]
[54.225417, "o", "\r\n"]
[54.225652, "o", "\r\n"]
[54.22588, "o", "### Setup"]
[54.226129, "o", "\r\n"]
[54.226372, "o", "We conduct our experiment with Anaconda3. If you have installed Anaconda3, then create the environment for P-tuning v2:"]
[54.226622, "o", "\r\n"]
[54.226856, "o", "\r\n"]
[54.227102, "o", "```shell"]
[54.227384, "o", "\r\n"]
[54.227641, "o", "conda create -n pt2 python=3.8.5"]
[54.227866, "o", "\r\n"]
[54.228122, "o", "conda activate pt2"]
[54.228362, "o", "\r\n"]
[54.2286, "o", "```"]
[54.228826, "o", "\r\n"]
[54.229069, "o", "\r\n"]
[54.229305, "o", "After we setup basic conda environment, install pytorch related packages via:"]
[54.229643, "o", "\r\n"]
[54.230598, "o", "\r\n"]
[54.230803, "o", "```shell"]
[54.231087, "o", "\r\n"]
[54.23125, "o", "conda install -n pt2 pytorch==1.7.1 torchvision==0.8.2 torchaudio==0.7.2 cudatoolkit=11.0 -c pytorch"]
[54.23142, "o", "\r\n"]
[54.23159, "o", "```"]
[54.231838, "o", "\r\n"]
[54.231952, "o", "\r\n"]
[54.232114, "o", "Finally, install other python packages we need:\r\n\r\n"]
[54.232273, "o", "```shell"]
[54.232428, "o", "\r\n"]
[54.232588, "o", "pip install -r requirements.txt"]
[54.232684, "o", "\r\n"]
[54.232758, "o", "```"]
[54.232836, "o", "\r\n\r\n### Data"]
[54.232883, "o", "\r\n"]
[54.23293, "o", "For SuperGLUE and SQuAD datasets, we download them from the Huggingface Datasets APIs (embedded in our codes)."]
[54.23303, "o", "\r\n"]
[54.23306, "o", "\r\nFor sequence tagging (NER, SRL) datasets, we prepare a non-official packup [here](https://zenodo.org/record/6318701/files/P-tuning-v2_data.tar.gz?download=1). \r\n"]
[54.233097, "o", "After downloading, unzip the packup to the project root."]
[54.233196, "o", "\r\nPlease use at your own risk.\r\n"]
[54.233243, "o", "\r\n"]
[54.233341, "o", "### Training\r\nRun training scripts in [run_script](run_script) (e.g., RoBERTa for RTE):"]
[54.233888, "o", "\r\n"]
[54.233985, "o", "\r\nYou can change the augments and run:\r\n```shell\r\nbash run_script/run_rte_roberta.sh\r\n```\r\nor"]
[54.234106, "o", "\r\n"]
[54.234136, "o", "\r\n```shell\r\n"]
[54.234227, "o", "export TASK_NAME=superglue"]
[54.234257, "o", "\r\nexport DATASET_NAME=rte\r\nexport CUDA_VISIBLE_DEVICES=0"]
[54.234293, "o", "\r\n"]
[54.234337, "o", "bs=32"]
[54.234473, "o", "\r\n"]
[54.234504, "o", "lr=5e-3\r\ndropout=0.1\r\n"]
[54.234607, "o", "psl=128"]
[54.234683, "o", "\r\nepoch=100\r\npython3 run.py \\\r\n  --model_name_or_path /wjn/pre-trained-lm/roberta-large \\"]
[54.234715, "o", "\r\n  --task_name $TASK_NAME \\\r\n  --dataset_name $DATASET_NAME \\"]
[54.234751, "o", "\r\n"]
[54.234902, "o", "  --do_train \\\r\n"]
[54.234989, "o", "  --do_eval \\\r\n  --max_seq_length 128 \\"]
[54.235054, "o", "\r\n"]
[54.235095, "o", "  --per_device_train_batch_size $bs \\"]
[54.235651, "o", "\r\n  --learning_rate $lr \\\r\n  --num_train_epochs $epoch \\\r\n  --output_dir checkpoints/$DATASET_NAME-roberta/ \\\r\n  --overwrite_output_dir \\\r\n  --hidden_dropout_prob $dropout \\\r\n  --seed 11 \\\r\n  --save_strategy no \\\r\n  --evaluation_strategy epoch \\\r\n  --prefix\r\n```"]
[54.235713, "o", "\r\n"]
[54.235843, "o", "This script is run for Full-data Full-supervised Pre-fix Tuning.\r\n"]
[54.235934, "o", "\r\nWe provide the following kinds of settings:\r\n- Full-data v.s. Few-shot: The training data is full / few-shot\r\n- Full-supervised v.s. Semi-supervised: We use full-supervised / self-training"]
[54.23598, "o", "\r\n"]
[54.236093, "o", "- Full-Tuning v.s. Patameter-efficient Tuning: Only tuning the full parameters / Tuning the few parameters"]
[54.236123, "o", "\r\n- One-stage v.s. Two-stage: directly tuning / tuning the few paraemters and then tuning the full\r\n- Head-Tuning v.s. Prompt-Tuning: Prefix/Adapter + CLS head / Prefix/Adapter + Prompt + Vaberlizer\r\n"]
[54.236159, "o", "\r\n"]
[54.236258, "o", "The specific augments for different scenarios:\r\n\r\n"]
[54.236376, "o", "\r\n"]
[54.236407, "o", "#### Few-shot Head Tuning\r\n\r\n### Implemented Results\r\nCurrently we have released our reimplementation on following tasks and datasets. More implementation will be released soon."]
[54.236503, "o", "\r\n"]
[54.236532, "o", "\r\nReleased results on BERT-large\r\n\r\n|              | BoolQ | COPA | RTE  | WiC  | WSC  | CoNLL04 | OntoNotes 5.0 | CoNLL12 |\r\n"]
[54.236625, "o", "|--------------|-------|------|------|------|------|---------|---------------|---------|"]
[54.236658, "o", "\r\n| Result       | 74.3  | 77.0 | 80.1 | 75.1 | 68.3 | 84.5    | 86.4          | 85.3    |\r\n| Total Epochs | 100   | 80   | 60   | 80   | 80   | 40      | 30            | 45      |\r\n"]
[54.236759, "o", "| Best Epoch   | 58    | 12   | 30   | 56   | 17   | 33      | 24            | 43      |"]
[54.236789, "o", "\r\n\r\nReleased results on RoBERTa-large\r\n\r\n"]
[54.236825, "o", "|              | BoolQ | COPA | RTE  | WiC  | WSC  | CoNLL03 | CoNLL04 | OntoNotes 5.0 | CoNLL12 | CoNLL05 WSJ | CoNLL05 Brown | SQuAD 1.1 | SQuAD 2.0 |"]
[54.237048, "o", "\r\n|--------------|-------|------|------|------|------|---------|---------|---------------|---------|-------------|---------------|-----------|-----------|\r\n| Results      | 84.0  | 92.0 | 86.6 | 73.7 | 64.4 | 91.8    | 88.4    | 90.1          | 84.7    | 89.4        | 83.9          | 88.1/94.2 | 81.3/84.7 |\r\n| Total Epochs | 100   | 120  | 100  | 50   | 10   | 30      | 80      | 60            | 45      | 15          | -             | 30        | 10        |\r\n| Best Epoch   | 86    | 78   | 65   | 31   | 3    | 28      | 45      | 59            | 37      | 13          | -             | 24        | 9         |\r\n\r\nFor other hyper-parameters, please refer to the training scripts. \r\nIf you can not achieve the reported results at the best epoch, there is probably an environmental mismatch and hyper-parameter search is needed.\r\n\r\n## Citation\r\n\r\nIf you find our work useful, please kindly cite our paper:\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\nuse_prompt\r\nsst-2,mr,cr,mnli,snli,qnli,rte,mrpc,qqp,cola,trec\r\n"]
[54.23725, "o", "\r\n"]
[54.237278, "o", "\r\n\r\nsuperglue\r\nBoolQ\tCB\tCOPA\tMultiRC\tReCoRD\tRTE\tWiC\tWSC\tAX-b\tAX-g\r\nglue\r\nCoLA\tSST-2\tMRPC\tSTS-B\tQQP\tMNLI-m\tMNLI-mm\tQNLI\tRTE\t"]
[54.237406, "o", "WNLI"]
[54.237487, "o", "\t"]
[54.237528, "o", "AX"]
[54.237568, "o", "\r\n"]
[54.237699, "o", "\r\n"]
[54.237782, "o", "\r\n"]
